    fb: 'The tram goes almost to the sea, and from the last stop you can see a striped lighthouse. I sketched it fast, with the paint still running down the page.\n\nThat is my favorite way to sketch a city: lines first, then wet color that does not quite stay inside them. Is there a place on your daily route you keep meaning to draw?',
