    fb: 'This is what a desk looks like at 1 a.m. One lamp, a screen with a game paused, string lights and photos pinned on the wall. Everything else is gone in the dark.\n\nPainting it was like painting a small campfire. Copper and green light, purple shadows. Are you a late-night person?',
