    fb: 'Someone lives in this mushroom. There is a round door, a window with a warm light and rain running down the red cap.\n\nI painted the rain in streaks of blue straight across everything. It makes the house look even cozier, because you know it is dry inside. Would you live in a mushroom house if you could?',
